---
servings: 1
title: Single Frozen Pizza (CSO)
tags: CSO, steam, AI
source.author: AI Cooking Agent
course: Lunch
cook time: 15 min
description: Produce a crispy, evenly cooked frozen pizza in a Sub-Zero Wolf steam oven. The steam-assisted convection mode does not dry out your food like a dry oven, or ruining the texture and experience like a microwave.
---

Preheat the #Convection Steam Oven{} (CSO) to 400°F on Convection Steam mode.

Unwrap your @frozen pizza{1}(single-serving, Red Baron or other brand) and place it on a #perforated pan{} on the modular rack in the oven. Cook for ~{8%minutes} from frozen.

Change to (dry) Convection mode 425°F and cook for an additional ~{5%minutes} until the cheese is melted and the crust is golden brown.
